  `PHASE2E1A_TRAINER_PARITY_IMPL_CODEX_PASS`
  (`trainer_gpu_parity_impl/22_CODEX_GO_NO_GO_AFTER_REMEDIATION.md`).
- 2E1.B trainer output contract:
